# The sample access variation point attaches to the HTTP example: it adds its
# command middleware (src/Middleware/Access, src/Middleware/BatchLimit, with
# their scenarios in src/Middleware.Tests), its HTTP middleware
# (Api/Http/Middleware/Authentication), and the marks in Shared, and changes
# only the composition root, the command it marks with its project, and the
# readme and Makefile.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-http-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Commands/Todo.Commands.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Commands/PlanItemsCommand.cs
change Makefile
change README.md
